<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33752" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wound, lacerate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				405
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ὄνυξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					630a5
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ulcerate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέφαρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			, al.:—
				Pass.
			, of persons, <i>to suffer from wounds</i> or <i>sores,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Com.Adesp.
				106.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				16.20
			</span></i>; of sores, <i>suppurate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>make an incision in</i> a tree, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.16.1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			),<i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				3.2.2
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. φρένας, οἴκους</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				878
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				223
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν διάνοιαν ἑλκοῦσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.551
				</span></i>
			.</div>
